n not too crowded to walk around comfortably around the place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2018-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "B06AEE9496A742B4833EE9331862A0C3", "name": "Deeptanshu K", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/DK6983", "username": "DK6983", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/10/d8/70/d2/deeptanshu-k.jpg", "contribution_count": 40, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 187309, "location_name": "Munich", "location_name_detailed": "Munich, Germany"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-04", "published_at_date": "2018-04-04"}, {"review_id": 570876771, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r570876771-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Amazing temple. Watch out for con men", "text": "Amazing temple and architecture. You are only allowed inside if you are a Hindu. There was a man offering advice about blessing times, and claimed to be s holy man. Asking for money outside the temple and followed us inside, pestering us for money in exchange for ‘blessings’ .It’s a shame people choose to try to make money this way at a holy site . Lots of monkeys around inside and outside the temple. If you are a tourist people will convince you to buy lots of things to give as blessings. Be careful ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 2, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-04-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "5DC3BF291890AC8864A9288BB2A6E627", "name": "C 20", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/c20travelbug", "username": "c20travelbug", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/13/0c/d7/ae/cb202020.jpg", "contribution_count": 116, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186333, "location_name": "Leicestershire", "location_name_detailed": "Leicestershire, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-03", "published_at_date": "2018-04-04"}, {"review_id": 570782397, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r570782397-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Nice temple", "text": "So nice temple ,it is hindu biggest god Mahadev shiva´s temple. Really beautiful ,many many small temples are there around pashupati .it is very  ancient temple.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2018-03-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "9F734DC4BDE62F92EE5E813154878397", "name": "prayagkapur", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/prayagkapur", "username": "prayagkapur", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e2/a7/default-avatar-2020-44.jpg", "contribution_count": 4, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 293860, "location_name": "India", "location_name_detailed": "India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-03", "published_at_date": "2018-04-04"}, {"review_id": 570748027, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r570748027-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A stunning and holy place", "text": "I was apprehensive to visit this religious site due to the fact they burn bodies but I found it the most calming, peaceful and spiritual place. It's truly somewhere I would recommend to everyone visiting Kathmandu and wanting to escape the madness of it all! ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-03-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "70266A5367D6BE9008C65EA07401AC9D", "name": "Lou W", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/lou_watsham", "username": "lou_watsham", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/09/78/a6/10/louise-w.jpg", "contribution_count": 70, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186338, "location_name": "London", "location_name_detailed": "London, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-04-03", "published_at_date": "2018-04-04"}, {"review_id": 570517636, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r570517636-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Hindu cremation center", "text": "Not being Hindu, this was very strange yet fascinating. This location  is a long a holy river.  This site is also a place of pilgrimage as well as cremation.  To understand and appreciate what you are saying, a guide is most worthwhile.  As a tourist, we were able to walk along one side of the river and watch several cremations taking place.  The wrapped bodies,  after being anointed by water from the river, are placed on wooden Logs and straw is placed around the body.  We observed as various rituals were taking place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-03-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "2FD3BEBC16F885685AD1DDBC0627EC43", "name": "Manny B", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/2ndGen", "username": "2ndGen", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/06/6d/1c/79/manny-b.jpg", "contribution_count"